{"height": 16, "weight": 855, "base_experience": 239, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-defense", "value": 3}], "genus": "Shellfish Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["monster", "water1"], "gender_rate": 1, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "カメックス"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Kamex"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "거북왕"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "水箭龜"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Tortank"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Turtok"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Blastoise"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Blastoise"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "カメックス"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "水箭龟"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Blastoise"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["red", "blue"], "text": "A brutal POKéMON with pressurized water jets on its shell. They are used for high speed tackles."}, {"versions": ["yellow", "lets-go-pikachu", "lets-go-eevee"], "text": "Once it takes aim at its enemy, it blasts out water with even more force than a fire hose."}, {"versions": ["gold"], "text": "It deliberately makes itself heavy so it can with­ stand the recoil of the water jets it fires."}, {"versions": ["silver"], "text": "The rocket cannons on its shell fire jets of water capable of punch­ ing holes through thick steel."}, {"versions": ["crystal"], "text": "It firmly plants its feet on the ground before shooting water from the jets on its back."}, {"versions": ["ruby", "sapphire"], "text": "BLASTOISE has water spouts that protrude from its shell. The water spouts are very accurate. They can shoot bullets of water with enough accuracy to strike empty cans from a distance of over 160 feet."}, {"versions": ["emerald"], "text": "The waterspouts that protrude from its shell are highly accurate. Their bullets of water can precisely nail tin cans from a distance of over 160 feet."}, {"versions": ["firered", "x", "sword"], "text": "It crushes its foe under its heavy body to cause fainting.